# PRIMARY OBJECTIVE

Design CareerRadar as a production-ready backend system built in THREE STAGES.

Every stage must produce a usable application.

Each stage should be deployable independently.

Every stage should add significant interview value.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# STAGE 1 (Highest Priority)

Goal

Automatically detect relevant jobs.

Features

- Save companies to monitor
- Crawl career pages every hour
- Detect newly posted jobs
- Detect removed jobs
- Avoid duplicate notifications
- Filter only software engineering roles
- Filter by my skills
- Send email notifications immediately
- Dashboard showing detected jobs
- Dashboard showing crawler health
- Dashboard showing last crawl status
- Dashboard showing failed crawls
- Logging
- Retry logic
- Idempotency
- Observability
- Docker deployment

This stage should be production-ready.

